! - As of 30/06/2026, this list actively _prevents_ users from using it in MV3 extensions. And even if it wasn't prevented by principle, MV3 limitations would've prevented RegEx entries from working, most crucially the one for "utm_". In that case, changing to an MV2 web browser is currently the only fix (shy of anyone forking this list, I guess). If you use Windows, running "winget search mv2; winget search gecko" in PowerShell will show a more-or-less up-to-date list of browsers that support this list.
